  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are continuous on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>So, for continuity</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
